 Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a> is applied before the Strength saving throw.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202844\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2570/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32885/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9728/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 491/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 854396/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.557      1 Template:Area_page\n100.00%   64.557      1 -total\n 33.77%   21.803      3 Template:Cond\n 29.56%   19.082      8 Template:Icon_text\n 28.67%   18.507      7 Template:Icon_link\n 25.58%   16.511     26 Template:Trim\n 25.09%   16.196      2 Template:Condition\n 19.28%   12.446      3 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 14.31%    9.236      8 Template:Ifempty\n 12.91%    8.337      9 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:39918-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202844 and revision id 371588. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}